## Model card

[Official September 10, 2026 announcement](https://forum.qoder.com/t/sonus-is-here-our-new-built-in-model-with-a-special-talent-for-computer-use/12408) verifies Sonus as Qoder's built-in model for long-running autonomous tasks, knowledge work, coding and computer use. It launched across Qoder, IDE, CLI, JetBrains, QoderWake and Cloud Agents; Desktop 0.2.3 supplies computer-use integration. The announcement gives a **3.2x credit multiplier**, not a dollar/token price. Later user comments question changing credit charges but are not an authoritative current tariff.

No independently documented checkpoint, parameter count, architecture, cutoff, total context or output limit recovered. Platform computer use does not establish the full native modality contract. No public standalone Chat Completions/Responses route or Zen Free ID verified; Qoder integration and unofficial proxy projects are not proof of a supported public model API.

[Official promotion terms](https://docs.qoder.com/events/sotafree) describe September 15–19 credit packs totaling **7,500**, followed by September 21–25 **4,000 daily / 20,000 total** credits, conditional on an active paid subscription. These expired, non-rollover promotions are not an ongoing free model tier. Earlier indexed totals reflect earlier offer revisions.

### Raw benchmarks found

Three fresh searches covering official release, independent benchmarks and pricing found no reproducible numeric Sonus quality benchmark. The official launch provides positioning and a demo, not SWE-bench, Terminal-Bench, OSWorld, GPQA, HLE, GDPval, Tau2/Tau3 or retrieval measurements. Forum anecdotes include both successful video-editing work and failed costly tasks; neither establishes a benchmark pass rate.

No verified public reasoning, coding, tool-use, multimodal or long-context score found for this exact identity. Other Qoder tiers, Cantus, Qwen models and inferred upstream identities are not substituted.

### Normalized scores (1–100)

Self-excluded: identity is verified but attributable benchmark evidence is insufficient for a complete Overall. No placeholder scores assigned.

